WEBVTT

00:00:00.177 --> 00:00:01.014
41-day streak.

00:00:01.014 --> 00:00:03.402
Every bar looks great.

00:00:03.402 --> 00:00:04.914
But one is hiding something.

00:00:08.300 --> 00:00:10.178
The gap you never practise is

00:00:10.178 --> 00:00:12.103
the one interviews find.

00:00:12.817 --> 00:00:15.288
Placiq's readiness view surfaces your primary

00:00:15.288 --> 00:00:17.663
bottleneck, so you fix the right

00:00:17.663 --> 00:00:18.488
thing first.

00:00:19.507 --> 00:00:20.307
Find your gap.

00:00:20.295 --> 00:00:21.207
Free.
